###############################################################################
# Topic Sentiment Analysis
#
# Análise de sentimento profunda de um tópico específico da audiência.
# Quando o usuário clica em "Sentimento" na UI, dispara uma análise
# que retorna: overall, emotional_map, drivers, tensões, dores, oportunidades.
#
# FLUXO:
#   1. GET  /sentiment          → primeira vez retorna "no_analysis"
#   2. POST /sentiment/refresh  → dispara análise em background (202)
#   3. GET  /sentiment          → durante processamento retorna "processing"
#   4. GET  /sentiment          → após ~2-3min retorna "ready" com dados
#
# NOTA: A análise é sob demanda (não automática). Só roda quando o
#       usuário solicita via POST refresh.
###############################################################################

@base_url = http://localhost:8000
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJiNWYzOTZhOC1iYmU2LTRkOWItOGI5OS1jMGE1ZTc3ZjgwNzEiLCJ0eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzcxNzA1MTA4fQ.fdFgKKP9QH2Aan5ZDvXagzii8YTOLYo-bFO6RYb6cN8

# IDs de exemplo — substitua pelos seus
@audience_id = e9458348-6cad-4ba6-bf3e-87674d035613
@topic_id = 13129258-589b-4c3a-b7ab-aaf8f7d46346

###############################################################################
# 1. CONSULTAR SENTIMENTO DE UM TÓPICO
###############################################################################

### Consultar sentimento (primeira vez → status: "no_analysis")
# Retorna o estado atual da análise de sentimento do tópico.
#
# Respostas possíveis:
#   - "no_analysis": Nenhuma análise existe. Use POST /refresh para iniciar.
#   - "processing":  Análise em andamento. Aguarde 2-3 minutos.
#   - "ready":       Análise pronta. Retorna dados completos (ver abaixo).
#   - "failed":      Análise falhou. Verifique error_message.
#
# Quando status = "ready", os campos retornados são:
#   - overall_sentiment:      {score, positive_ratio, negative_ratio, neutral_ratio}
#   - emotional_map:          [{emotion, intensity, percentage, example}]
#   - sentiment_by_community: [{community, positive, negative, neutral, dominant_emotion}]
#   - sentiment_by_subtopic:  [{subtopic, sentiment, score, key_driver}]
#   - sentiment_drivers:      {positive: [{driver, frequency, mentions, example_quote}], negative: [...]}
#   - tension_points:         [{topic, for_ratio, against_ratio, intensity, summary}]
#   - pain_points:            [{pain, severity, frequency, communities, verbatim}]
#   - sentiment_opportunities:[{opportunity, based_on, confidence, target_audience}]
#
GET {{base_url}}/audiences/{{audience_id}}/topics/{{topic_id}}/sentiment
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###############################################################################
# 2. DISPARAR ANÁLISE DE SENTIMENTO
###############################################################################

### Iniciar análise de sentimento (retorna 202 Accepted)
# Dispara análise em background thread.
# Se já existe uma análise em processamento, retorna o status atual.
#
POST {{base_url}}/audiences/{{audience_id}}/topics/{{topic_id}}/sentiment/refresh
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###############################################################################
# 3. CENÁRIOS DE ERRO
###############################################################################

### Tópico inexistente (retorna 404)
GET {{base_url}}/audiences/{{audience_id}}/topics/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/sentiment
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Audiência inexistente (retorna 404)
GET {{base_url}}/audiences/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/topics/{{topic_id}}/sentiment
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
